            "review_text": "Kira Elyse\nGoulburn, Australia64 contributions\n0\nGreat food, poor service\nJan 2020 • Couples\nFive stars for the food\n\n0 stars for customer service\n\nWe absolutely loved the food here, it’s is filled with locals!\n\nThey have an English menu also\n\nUnfortunately, we received very poor customer service from a staff member, who appeared to be very annoyed by our presence, and was rude the whole time.\nHe gave us a dish we did not order (to try and make us spend more money) and when I asked what it was he proceeded to yell “5! 5! 5!”\nSo we just let it go.\n\nI would recommend to eat here, but don’t except good customer service, although we did only deal with this one staff member.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2020",
